 ## Background
-This technique is part of the DynamicVolumeRayCasting project by pengliu916 [S1, unofficial]. It is used as a preprocessing step for ray marching, where the generated cube geometry is used to render the volume boundaries or for debugging purposes [S1, unofficial]. The method is specific to the Direct3D 11 implementation described in the source [S1, unofficial].
